* You build the geomatics of the distribution network cadastre by ensuring the accuracy of the recorded information;
* You plan and carry out field interventions;
* You enter data, feed the computer database and update plans and cadastral information;
* You produce location or project plans;
* You inform and provide internal or external clients with the status of installations and, if necessary, mark their positioning on site;
* You participate in the evaluation and testing of new survey methods and also carry out surveys of third-party installations under mandate.

* Federal VET Diploma (CFC) as geomatician, civil engineering draughtsperson or equivalent training;
* Several years of professional experience;
* Knowledge of cadastre, civil engineering and distribution networks would be important assets;
* You master IT tools (MS Office, CAD) and topometry;
* Holder of a driving licence;
* You wish to invest your skills in an activity where your autonomy, rigour, organisational and planning skills are recognised and valued qualities.

